  m_Name: Evento_BicicletasCompartilhadasBombam
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Bicicletas Compartilhadas Bombam
  _titleEn: Bike Sharing Takes Off
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Sistemas de bicicleta compartilhada permitem pegar uma bicicleta numa
    esta\xE7\xE3o e devolver em outra, completando viagens curtas."
  _summaryEn: Bike sharing lets people pick up a bike at one station and drop it
    at another, covering short trips.
  _realWorld: "O Citi Bike, de Nova York, come\xE7ou em 2013 e virou um dos maiores
    sistemas do mundo; v\xE1rias capitais brasileiras t\xEAm sistemas parecidos."
  _realWorldEn: New York's Citi Bike started in 2013 and became one of the largest
    systems in the world; several Brazilian capitals have similar systems.
  _tradeOffs: "Sem ciclovias, o uso cai; esta\xE7\xF5es concentradas nas \xE1reas
    ricas deixam a periferia de fora."
  _tradeOffsEn: Without bike lanes, use drops; stations concentrated in wealthy areas
    leave the outskirts out.
  _sources:
  - Label: Citi Bike (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Citi_Bike
  - Label: "Sistema de bicicletas compartilhadas (Wikip\xE9dia)"
    Url: https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sistema_de_bicicletas_compartilhadas
